    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105-a1">

                <pb facs="0137" n="63" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg63"/>

                <head>Mr. McDougall to Mr. Burnley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary’s Office,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Quebec,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 27, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Adverting to your letter of the 12th of
                    October last, I have the honor to inform you, by command of his excellency the
                    governor general, that a warrant is this day sent to the sheriff of the district
                    of San Francisco, at Sherbroke, Canada East, for the extradition of W. H.
                    Crawford to the United States authorities.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. McDOUGALL, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. H. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Burnley,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
